  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safeguarding tribal rights in the context of extractive industries operating in India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To promote recognition and protection of tribal (Adivasi) rights in 8 Indian states faced with extractive industries operating on their ancestral land and to contribute to more sustainable and accountable extractive corporations practices.</narrative>
  </description>
